---
// About + experience. Employers are named here (in experience), not in the hero.
---

<section id="about">
  <div class="wrap about-grid">
    <div class="about" data-reveal>
      <p
        class="i18n"
        data-en="I care about how a product feels and how it's built, in equal measure."
        data-pt="Me importo com como um produto se sente e como ele é feito, na mesma medida."
      >
        I care about how a product feels and how it's built, in equal measure.
      </p>
      <p
        class="body i18n"
        data-en="I'm a design engineer with five years in tech, based in São Paulo. I move comfortably between Figma and the codebase: designing interfaces, then building them in React, TypeScript, and Tailwind, with attention to motion and accessibility. I also research UX so the decisions hold up beyond looks."
        data-pt="Sou design engineer com cinco anos em tech, em São Paulo. Transito bem entre o Figma e o código: desenho interfaces e depois as construo em React, TypeScript e Tailwind, com atenção a movimento e acessibilidade. Também pesquiso UX pra que as decisões se sustentem além da aparência."
      >
        I'm a design engineer with five years in tech, based in São Paulo. I move comfortably between
        Figma and the codebase: designing interfaces, then building them in React, TypeScript, and
        Tailwind, with attention to motion and accessibility. I also research UX so the decisions hold
        up beyond looks.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="exp" data-reveal>
      <div class="grp-lbl i18n" data-en="Experience" data-pt="Experiência">Experience</div>
      <div class="item">
        <div class="role i18n" data-en="Front-end / Design Engineer" data-pt="Front-end / Design Engineer">
          Front-end / Design Engineer
        </div>
        <div class="co">Acesso Energia</div>
        <div
          class="desc i18n"
          data-en="Led the migration from vanilla CSS to Tailwind, cutting the time to build and change screens across the product."
          data-pt="Liderei a migração de CSS puro para Tailwind, reduzindo o tempo de construir e mudar telas no produto."
        >
          Led the migration from vanilla CSS to Tailwind, cutting the time to build and change screens
          across the product.
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="note i18n"
        data-en="Full timeline on LinkedIn and my résumé."
        data-pt="Histórico completo no LinkedIn e no meu currículo."
      >
        Full timeline on LinkedIn and my résumé.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
